{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"47a6741f0849fdab12db8991df7a730a103d3d5c6554f5800c5e97b49604c094","ja":"お茶会をしましょう","zh":"来办茶会吧","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f4faf5eb62b0168b38842b7f49e94039f9d410cae54f28d9f16a985a5e48978e","ja":"あ、エミリーちゃん！\n来てくれてありがとう。","zh":"啊，艾米莉！\n谢谢你特意过来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7e84cc6d1bc2ab8dccf096a674e713d6dc20163c0cc75608d0163d216b13810b","ja":"いえ、頼っていただけて嬉しいです。\nそれで、ご相談したいことと言うのはなんでしょう？","zh":"没有，能被您依靠我也很高兴。\n那么，您想找我商量的是什么事呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7cc394c5f6f30325e4ceb19d2afa6be8e87bc9a3f512a8f33acd4525889b3935","ja":"実は今度、ドラマでアフタヌーンティーのシーンを\n撮ることになって。それでマナーを教えてほしいの。","zh":"其实下次我要拍一段电视剧里的\n下午茶场景，所以想请你教教我相关的礼仪。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f12548536625b1c849f08ef8501b90376a3ebe0d49238236986a73ee9a5a0635","ja":"さすが琴葉さん、勉強熱心ですね。それなら、\n実際にお茶会を開いてみるのはいかがでしょう？","zh":"真不愧是琴叶，真好学呢。既然这样，\n实际举办一次茶会看看如何？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3755fc5d9394407adcbb6b8849f775f474b1aa786f46c96306182868be54bc5c","ja":"わぁ……すごく助かるよ♪\nそれじゃあ、お言葉に甘えちゃおうかな。","zh":"哇……帮了大忙呢♪\n那我就恭敬不如从命啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f341f41613ce757706ed1274a25e164618d5ee9a2c4a3f4b7bcac3c1eeffff50","ja":"はい！　では、まずは準備から！\nお茶会に欠かせない紅茶などを買いに行きましょう♪","zh":"好！那么，首先从准备开始！\n去买茶会不可或缺的红茶等物品吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"58e3b82c2bd13813750d0368c1ef261d31aff33796d9f6a5320352209b1f2c1c","ja":"紅茶に、サンドイッチに、スコーンに、ケーキ……\nうん、これで一通りそろったかな？","zh":"红茶、三明治、司康饼、蛋糕……\n嗯，这样差不多就齐了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0ff8b62f79c64c3b28a104a45c3eb37646a79442f0c4decbe52449345e3ca826","ja":"はい、そうですね……あっ！","zh":"是的，是啊……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b82b67189b240f08cc8879b80089fa6ebbc46c203917e28b60a6b31ba2e35bcc","ja":"何か他に買いたいものがあった？\nそれなら、いったん別行動しよっか。","zh":"还有其他想买的东西吗？\n那样的话，我们先分开行动吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2b9f69afd221bf18908e922f8bf78bdc0ed806d052a30e137d8aee0e37409aa6","ja":"ええと……はい。ありがとうございます。\nでは10分後に……よろしいでしょうか？","zh":"那个……好的。非常感谢。\n那么定在10分钟后……可以吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1726.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"33fd5e5121707217c1332d5cbbe356541a48b6b1fe10b5e86b999548369709b1","ja":"うん。私もノートを切らしてたから\nちょうどよかったよ。それじゃあ、また後でね！","zh":"嗯。我的笔记本也刚好用完了，\n来得正是时候呢。那就待会儿见啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
